    <title>和富二代朋友聊完，我心理平衡了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5857a9a4972c496dfca071</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5857a9a4972c496dfca071</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期聊天视频《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1otNA6EEui/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=d3e551b34f48c400923c1db4a22d4690" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1otNA6EEui/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=d3e551b34f48c400923c1db4a22d4690"><span>和富二代朋友聊完，我心理平衡了吗？</span></a><span>》的纯音频。</span></p><p><span>——</span></p><p><span>大家好，我是娄娄。 </span></p><p><span>这位是我的朋友 Linda。 </span></p><p><span>她身上有一个我很好奇，也有一点不敢轻易评价的标签：富二代。</span></p><p><span> 作为一个来自二线城市小康之家的普通女孩， 我对富二代这一群体有很多好奇， 也有一些很微妙、复杂的情绪。</span></p><p><span> 今天，我准备和Linda聊聊我认识她之后， 积攒的很多问题和感受。</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 富二代是一种怎样的体验？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 家里要A几才能是一个富二代啊？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 富二代最看不上的两种富二代</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 松弛是富人的必备素养</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 真诚，重要吗？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 婚前协议怎么签？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 条件差距大的婚姻在现实里长什么样？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 喜欢的人不被家人接受怎么办？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 生来有钱，还有什么好烦恼的？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> 有钱也解决不了的问题是什么？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 共情与无法被共情</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 富二代最羡慕普通人的时刻</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 消费的意义</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 人类需要朋友！</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 每个人都有自己的人生游戏</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家去看</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1otNA6EEui/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=d3e551b34f48c400923c1db4a22d4690" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1otNA6EEui/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=d3e551b34f48c400923c1db4a22d4690"><span>视频</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>喜欢这期内容的朋友，别忘了点赞、投币、收藏一键三连哦！</span></p><p><span> 关注我，下期再见！</span></p>]]></description>
