  <item>
    <title>E30 景德镇 乌托邦与我的孤独</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697a0899073030367a30eaa0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697a0899073030367a30eaa0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 13:06:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提示：由于话筒佩戴方向不一致，主播与嘉宾有音量差，后期已尽力修复，但仍对听感有较大影响，谢谢各位听友的谅解与包容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hello，大家好，我是娄娄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天节目的嘉宾是我在景德镇很喜欢的一家餐厅的老板兼厨师，也河。他的餐厅叫「无一处」，在一个名叫「湘湖」的小村庄的巷子深处，不容易让人找到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从第一次去「无一处」，我就莫名被它吸引。</span></p><span></span><p><span>直到这期播客剪完，我才明白我究竟是被什么吸引。</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢也河。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 也河与他的「无一处」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> “景德镇避雷帖”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 人与地方的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡尔维诺：“现在一切地方都可以瞬间与其他地方取得联系，孤独的感觉只能在从这个地方到那个地方的途中才能被体会到。就是说当人们不在任何地方时才会感觉到。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 也河的“认识地方，探索附近”活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 景德镇菜市场趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 景德镇为什么成为了新一代年轻人的乌托邦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 景漂与北漂沪漂的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">51:14</a> 也河的推荐：海川艺术古建筑修复服务部 曙光路鬼市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 你在景德镇逃避什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWH_Uj1ZkZmjlzG7NtrHsH-2ML8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm4hq7JfhG5fX0DNzaZGo7h-T2Q-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpzVre6zedXWqaeXMOBagcgHblC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlYJEsltBeb2zee3k_8PBlUd_Vtb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqPc1n9GDu0V69acO01dJfMpbO1g.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljaIo8d_93WCfpMcROsRjaSVUdb1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhXms5IiaFQ4oXgffQFVACuVWKML.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlBV0S2FVr8c3KE5zddm-VFK3-p7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfXoXDqQwluh6y8vV8UuHipjv0t.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEUuK4b-bCCXNmqmdGxDcYbWPeT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：请加主播微信GentleLou</span></p>]]></description>
