  <item>
    <title>E24 关于福建白茶的避坑建议与冲泡建议（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670fe6220d2f24f289a81234</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670fe6220d2f24f289a81234</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Oct 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>接（上）期，这一期继续聊聊福建白茶怎么买、怎么喝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾叫做孙凡祎，一位90后茶四代女性，福建福鼎管阳人，她家到她已经是第四代做茶了。一个福鼎家庭，把茶叶从统购统销时代做到大宗出口贸易时代，到她又是一个本土市场流行时代。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 1 福建白茶怎么买？】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 福建白茶有散茶和饼茶，我该怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 买老白茶如何避坑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 一些朴素的茶叶做旧方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 如何从口感上区辨不同年份的白茶？有什么差异？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 建议还是不要过于执迷荒野茶古树茶</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 不同等级的福建白茶对应的市场价格区间</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 2 福建白茶怎么喝？】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 不同等级的白茶怎么泡？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 喝老寿眉，焖大约两轮，煮别超15分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">20:44</a> 泡白茶的水可以软软的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 福建白茶的建议冲泡水温</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> “福建白茶作为一种食材”，多样饮品方式延展</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 3 推荐团购2024福鼎管阳牡丹王】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1729">28:49</a> </span></strong><span>白毫银针太贵，老寿眉略深，特级白牡丹刚刚好。团个当年新的，新茶见真章，也没有年份上能忽悠人的空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 2024白牡丹介绍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lipqu-bgiquYJNAfCH7vXfmQM1Y9.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这期节目，请帮助我们多多分享。欢迎你给我们评论互动、提问或指正。欢迎加入听友群👉请先加微信 GentleLou，主播营业👈来和更多茶友会面。群内亦有不定期的美美团购。感谢收听，望常相伴。</span></p>]]></description>
