  <item>
    <title>E23 关于福建白茶的12个基本问题（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670cdd550d2f24f289ff61d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670cdd550d2f24f289ff61d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>目标是听完这一期你去买福建白茶的时候能听懂人在说什么，能看懂包装上写的都是些什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾叫做孙凡祎，一位90后茶四代女性，福建福鼎管阳人，她家到她已经是第四代做茶了。一个福鼎家庭，把茶叶从统购统销时代做到大宗出口贸易时代，到她又是一个本土市场流行时代。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 1. 福建白茶在中国本土市场流行起来之前是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 2. 白毫银针、白牡丹、寿眉/贡眉......福建白茶的</span><strong><span>等级</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 3. 福建白茶的</span><strong><span>产地</span></strong><span>与</span><strong><span>品种</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 4. 喝白茶，喝的是一个什么</span><strong><span>风味</span></strong><span>？新茶老茶各领风骚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 5. 福建白茶是从什么时候开始有</span><strong><span>存放转化</span></strong><span>这个概念的？老茶是不是一种纯营销？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> 6. 不同等级的福建白茶，不一样的</span><strong><span>存茶思维</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a></span></strong><span> 7. 老白茶是年份越久越好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2493">41:33</a> 8. 白茶工艺之干燥：</span><strong><span>碳焙和电焙有何不同？</span></strong><span>不同干燥方式对茶叶的后期转化有什么影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> 9. 白茶工艺之萎凋：</span><strong><span>日晒</span></strong><span>白茶有多少？有多好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">53:18</a> 10. 自己存茶需要注意些什么？</span><strong><span>存茶建议</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> 11. 福建白茶里的</span><strong><span>荒野茶？野生茶？古树茶？菜茶？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">64:40</a> 12. 茶四代如何看待福建白茶的流行？白茶值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4194">69:54</a> 彩蛋：嘉宾自制福建白茶风味轮👇仅做参考！仅供娱乐！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYuXODGxlZ8GUT076eLVTHjXN-v.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这期节目，请帮助我们多多分享。欢迎你给我们评论互动、提问或指正。欢迎加入听友群👉请先加微信 GentleLou，主播营业👈来和更多茶友会面。群内亦有不定期的美美团购。感谢收听，望常相伴。</span></p>]]></description>
