  <item>
    <title>E20 春意浓，请收下这份春夏绿茶品饮指南！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660e91ed4f66d1c1da0876d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660e91ed4f66d1c1da0876d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Apr 2024 11:41:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 1 绿茶是什么】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 绿茶是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 中国绿茶这么多，绿茶和绿茶之间究竟有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> </span><strong><span>对绿茶风味差异起有决定性影响的工艺环节：炒青、蒸青、烘青、晒青......你分清了吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> </span></strong><span>日晒，开启茶叶另一个世界的大门（</span><a href="https://m.tb.cn/h.5BUJoB3nQohaFGq?tk=rDLEWKYdMUq" data-url="https://m.tb.cn/h.5BUJoB3nQohaFGq?tk=rDLEWKYdMUq"><span>此处给大家倾情推荐我店一款晒红</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 喝龙井一定要知道的知识点：豆花香、豆香、炒豆香与“狮峰”的三种含义</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 让茶叶好喝的三种途径：发酵之味、时间之味、自认本味</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 对绿茶风味差异产生影响的大产地因素：啊～是板栗清煮熟后甜甜的香～是咬一口玉米梗或甘蔗那一瞬间汁水流入口中的香～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 2 绿茶怎么买】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 一个暴论：喝龙井请一定狠心上预算！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 买绿茶也可以不赶早：这一场早生种与群体种的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a> 中国每个地方都有自己的绿茶？这是一种误解（但好喝就行）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 什么是野生茶？当我们买野生茶时，应该有怎样的预期？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 令人眼花缭乱的茶叶等级，到底要怎么选才好？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2814">46:54</a> 怎样判断自己买的茶叶对不对？质量与特性，两条腿走路</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">50:43</a> 敲黑板划重点：喝茶，浓淡与薄厚是两个概念</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a> 给喝茶新生买绿茶的一点小建议：“我反对出道即巅峰”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3531">58:51</a> 绿茶的各种名字太多了！从茶名上我们就可以区辨这是一款怎样的绿茶</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 一点趣谈：大浙江有大龙井，“散装”江苏各地开各花</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 3 绿茶怎么喝】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">60:05</a> 强烈建议！用盖碗或茶壶泡绿茶是另一番天地</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4138">68:58</a> 玻璃杯泡绿茶，为什么要注意区分上投法与下投法？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4447">74:07</a> 绿茶性寒伤胃？绿茶真的冤枉啊！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Part 4 从绿茶聊开来】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4913">81:53</a> 日本绿茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5039">83:59</a> 绿茶喝鲜爽，黄茶喝鲜醇</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>李浩源，@茶叶鉴定狮，十余年茶行业从业人员，二级评茶员。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗</span></p><span></span><p><span>你或许还会对这些感兴趣：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6423147e179eec533196e44d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6423147e179eec533196e44d"><span>E1 喝口好龙井，真挺难的</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/645bd4a0306513184ca0f661" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/645bd4a0306513184ca0f661"><span>E5 绿茶新秀安吉白，好看好喝还不贵</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/648175d953a5e5ea142ef1bf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/648175d953a5e5ea142ef1bf"><span>E7 那些购买有机茶的人，究竟在为什么买单？</span></a><span>》</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这期节目，请帮助我们分享给你身边或许也会喜欢这期节目的人。欢迎你给我们评论互动、提问或指正。如果你想加入我们的听友群请加微信【GentleLou】。感谢收听！望常相伴。</span></p>]]></description>
